PACK vector 1
MAPPED Vector f16
MAPPED FieldSeed f16 derived
-- THE VECTOR (#1143): `Vector:<id>.v` is a list of numbers kept in the native store, compact (f16), not in the entity's row: write a list to it, read a list of floats back in a
-- rule (`dot`, `norm`, `unit`, `distance` take it), and `near(q, 'Vector', k)` finds the k nearest instances by cosine. The first vector written fixes the dimension; another length is
-- refused with a receipt on the entity (`refused`). A stored row and an `entity_read` without a property show `[1024 numbers, f16]`; `entity_read` with `prop: v` prints them all.
Vector.dim getter: len(this.v)
-- THE SEEDS of the field (packs/field.c1f): `FieldSeed:<entity eid>.v` is a term's own embedding, written by the embed queue (packs/embed.c1f, which imports this pack, so the class is
-- declared here and not in the field pack). A class of its own, so `near(q, 'Vector', k)` never returns a seed. `derived`: stored and restored at a restart, never journalled (docs/cliffvm.md).
FieldSeed.dim getter: len(this.v)
